Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following changes were made to the original Project VisBug source by
Jieying Yang in 2026. Files listed under "Modified files" carry an in-file
modification notice as required by Section 4(b) of the Apache License.

Added capabilities (original work, not derived from Project VisBug):
  - AI prompt export: converts a visual revision session into a structured
    prompt that lets an AI coding agent locate the exact elements changed
  - Revision history: snapshot, diff and change-list panel
  - Properties panel, layer tree and comment layer
  - Reference image pipeline: image intake, local persistence and prompt
    embedding by absolute path
  - Drag-to-reorder layout editing and JSON import/export of revisions
  - Local font access integration
  - Simplified Chinese localization

Modified files:
  app/components/vis-bug/vis-bug.element.js
  app/features/selectable.js
  app/utilities/common.js
  extension/contextmenu/colormode.js
  extension/contextmenu/colorscheme.js
  extension/contextmenu/launcher.js
  extension/toolbar/inject.js
  extension/toolbar/restore.js
  extension/visbug.js

